#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Feeds the Voyager keymap overlay.

  voyager-keymap fetch [--layout <oryx url or hash>]
      Writes the layout to $XDG_STATE_HOME/voyager-keymap/layout.json, from Oryx
      when --layout is given, else from Keymapp's local cache. Prints one JSON
      status line.

  voyager-keymap practice on [--exit-key K] [--close-key K] [--move-key K] | off
      Turns practice mode on or off: a Hyprland submap whose catchall bind
      swallows every key, so nothing reaches apps or shortcuts while the
      overlay keeps showing presses. Inside it, the exit key leaves practice,
      the close key hides the overlay and the move key moves it.

  voyager-keymap watch
      Reads the Voyager's raw HID channel and prints a JSON line for each layer
      change and each key press or release, as the key's position in the layout.
      When Keymapp is not running, it asks the keyboard to send these events
      itself and asks it to stop again on exit.
"""

